{
  "id": "120",
  "title": "The Text Message",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-05-28",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang likes to tease his friends, but this time one of his friends teaches him a lesson.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/139/109a64a74c0e948f4bd8c46329f44bc7af97c3ea.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "短信\n\n    小王很喜欢捉弄人，没事就喜欢给朋友发短信。\n    有一次，他给朋友发了一条短信：你的手机欠费了，请充话费。后来朋友去充话费才发现被骗了。\n    第二天晚上两点，小王正在睡觉，突然手机响了，是一条短信。小王一看，气坏了。那条短信是：姿势不对，起来重睡！",
    "traditional": "短信\n\n    小王很喜歡捉弄人，沒事就喜歡給朋友發短信。\n    有一次，他給朋友發了一條短信：你的手機欠費了，請充話費。後來朋友去充話費才發現被騙了。\n    第二天晚上兩點，小王正在睡覺，突然手機響了，是一條短信。小王一看，氣壞了。那條短信是：姿勢不對，起來重睡！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Text Message"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小王很喜欢捉弄人，没事就喜欢给朋友发短信。",
      "traditional": "小王很喜歡捉弄人，沒事就喜歡給朋友發短信。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng hěn xǐ huan zhuō nòng rén méi shì jiù xǐ huan gěi péng you fā duǎn xìn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang loves to tease people, and sends text messages to his friends whenever he is free."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "有一次，他给朋友发了一条短信：你的手机欠费了，请充话费。",
      "traditional": "有一次，他給朋友發了一條短信：你的手機欠費了，請充話費。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yí cì tā gěi péng you fā le yì tiáo duǎn xìn nǐ de shǒu jī qiàn fèi le qǐng chōng huà fèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "后来朋友去充话费才发现被骗了。",
      "traditional": "後來朋友去充話費才發現被騙了。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái péng you qù chōng huà fèi cái fā xiàn bèi piàn le",
      "english": "One time, he sent a message to his friend saying: “Your phone is out of minutes, please add call credit.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The friend did not realize he had been fooled until later when he went to buy call credit."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "第二天晚上两点，小王正在睡觉，",
      "traditional": "第二天晚上兩點，小王正在睡覺，",
      "pinyin": "dì èr tiān wǎn shang liǎng diǎn xiǎo wáng zhèng zài shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "突然手机响了，是一条短信。",
      "traditional": "突然手機響了，是一條短信。",
      "pinyin": "tū rán shǒu jī xiǎng le shì yì tiáo duǎn xìn",
      "english": "The next day at two in the morning, Little Wang was asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小王一看，气坏了。",
      "traditional": "小王一看，氣壞了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng yí kàn qì huài le",
      "english": "Suddenly his phone made a noise. It was a text message."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "那条短信是：姿势不对，起来重睡！",
      "traditional": "那條短信是：姿勢不對，起來重睡！",
      "pinyin": "nà tiáo duǎn xìn shì zī shì bú duì qǐ lai chóng shuì",
      "english": "Little Wang took one look and got furious."
    }
  ],
