    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Text Message",
      "",
      "Little Wang loves to tease people, and sends text messages to his friends whenever he is free.",
      "",
      "One time, he sent a message to his friend saying: “Your phone is out of minutes, please add call credit.”",
      "The friend did not realize he had been fooled until later when he went to buy call credit.",
      "",
      "The next day at two in the morning, Little Wang was asleep.",
      "Suddenly his phone made a noise. It was a text message.",
      "Little Wang took one look and got furious.",
      "The text message said: “Your sleeping position is incorrect. Wake up and go back to sleep again.”"
    ]
  }
